  m_Name: case_6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 6
  context: "THE ROBBERY OF \"\"THE LADY WITH THE GREEN HAT\"\"\nOn Friday evening,
    during the night opening of the Mus\xE9e des Beaux-Arts in Villeneuve, the painting
    \"\"The Lady with the Green Hat\"\" (oil on canvas from 1887, estimated at 2.4
    million euros) disappeared from room 4 between 9:15 p.m. and 9:40 p.m. The empty
    frame was found in the cleaning room in the west corridor. About 120 guests were
    present. The thief knew the staff\u2019s alarm code and the floor plan."
  facts: "Alarm in room 4 deactivated with a personnel code at 9:14 p.m. \n90-second
    power outage at 9:32 p.m. \nWindow opened with a key, without any glass breakage
    \nEmpty frame found in the cleaning room, West\na waitress saw a man in a long
    gray coat take the service staircase and a coat was picked up from the cloakroom
    without a ticket at 9:40 p.m."
  suspects:
